			"Message": "feat(Build): Add bundled workbench profiles for Electron, Browser, Sessions, and all variants\n\nSigned-off-by: Nikola Hristov <Nikola@PlayForm.Cloud>",
			"SHA": "cd24e9be8f865a03a423d7f30eddd6f420c79735"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
